{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Warning:</strong> This is probably the hardest golf video game you will ever attempt to play.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>An Other Golf Game</strong> is an open-world sandbox life sim with survival, permadeath, and, yes\u2014golf. You\u2019ll need to figure out how to make money, navigate the world, and survive long enough to hit the course. There are no tutorials, and no hand-holding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work odd jobs, manage food, water, and sleep, and earn cash to keep your golfing dreams alive. Drive, explore, and try not to lose your clubs. When you die, you start over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Good luck. You'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2665 Transparency Section</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a passion project, created by just me\u2014a solo new developer who has worked various jobs at golf courses, from washing carts to caddying and everything in between. If you're interested in a life sim golf game that attempts to truly capture the essence of golf, I encourage you to join the Discord or post on the Steam forums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect the usual early access quirks\u2014weird Unity physics, janky moments, and frustrating deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Golfing, but without the bad parts removed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Living</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Permadeath</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Radios with multiple channels and custom station</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Immersion, 1st human only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...A hand sculpted ~4km x ~4km world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Multiple drivable vehicles+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Local golf course (The Oaks Bend)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Local golf course bar (The Soggy Oak)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Bar TV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...NPC Vehicles and interactions+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Jobs+</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...2nd ~Hidden golf course</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Dynamic wind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Touching grass</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Currency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Player stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Club stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Ball stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Urgent Care</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Full Day/Night</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Driving range, working ball machine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Road systems, highway, dirt, street, cart paths, etc</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Pro shop various products</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Town</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Gas station with gas pump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Towing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Menus/Save system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Steam achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Ambiance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Post life high score screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Left Hand Perspective*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Tournament*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Caddy job*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Wine Bar*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Rain*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u263a\ufe0e...Bar Arcade Game*  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*</strong> things that are not in the game whatsoever yet </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>+</strong> currently available with more to be added and improvements coming</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Hit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"Big Miss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"I Remember My First Beer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"You Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"Pest Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"Wasteful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"Amateur Picker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"Mycology Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"Spend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"},{"name":"The Butter Knife","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2474250/9ac6775e076bb059f072c6733bc3bb96adc7825b.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474250?t=1741302001","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741302001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474250/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741302001","capsule_imagev5"